{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TRLPsvGhM5mAr3obyN5V97","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Issue 4: Member search shows other members' phone numbers\n2\t\n3\t## Outcome\n4\t\n5\tSearching for a member at the desk shows who the member is (id and name), and never how to contact\n6\tthem. Anyone queueing at the desk can no longer read a member's phone number or email from the screen.\n7\t\n8\t## Requirements\n9\t\n10\t- When a volunteer searches for members by name, the system shall return only each member's id and name.\n11\t- When a volunteer searches for members by name, the system shall leave the phone number out of every result.\n12\t- When a volunteer searches for members by name, the system shall leave the email address out of every result.\n13\t- When a client calls `GET /api/members?q=<name>`, the system shall return results with no phone or email.\n14\t- When a volunteer runs `bun run desk search <name>`, the system shall print results with no phone or email.\n15\t- If no member matches the name, the system shall return an empty list.\n16\t\n17\t## Must not change\n18\t\n19\t- Search still finds members by any part of their name, case-insensitively, ordered by name.\n20\t- `src/auth/` is untouched.\n21\t- Lending checks still use the full member record (inductions, joined date) from the database.\n22\t- The `member_search` event is still logged with the query and the result count.\n23\t\n24\t## Out of scope\n25\t\n26\t- Showing contact details to coordinators through a new, separate view.\n27\t- Changing what is stored in the members table.\n28\t- Changes to the desk page's catalogue and loans tables.\n29\t\n30\t## Done when\n31\t\n32\t- The new tests in `tests/members/search.test.ts` pass, and the existing tests still pass.\n33\t- `bun run gate` exits 0.\n34\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"713e4ca1-e50a-4d2e-aeb9-ff302b09db60","uuid":"bb7f65cd-a4bc-4ca3-abe0-87b641f935a0","timestamp":"2026-11-13T05:08:28.217Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/user/software-factory-claude-code/parts/06-price-and-ship/03-ship-the-factory/solution/runs/4/repo/specs/4/SPEC.md","content":"# Issue 4: Member search shows other members' phone numbers\n\n## Outcome\n\nSearching for a member at the desk shows who the member is (id and name), and never how to contact\nthem. Anyone queueing at the desk can no longer read a member's phone number or email from the screen.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- When a volunteer searches for members by name, the system shall return only each member's id and name.\n- When a volunteer searches for members by name, the system shall leave the phone number out of every result.\n- When a volunteer searches for members by name, the system shall leave the email address out of every result.\n- When a client calls `GET /api/members?q=<name>`, the system shall return results with no phone or email.\n- When a volunteer runs `bun run desk search <name>`, the system shall print results with no phone or email.\n- If no member matches the name, the system shall return an empty list.\n\n## Must not change\n\n- Search still finds members by any part of their name, case-insensitively, ordered by name.\n- `src/auth/` is untouched.\n- Lending checks still use the full member record (inductions, joined date) from the database.\n- The `member_search` event is still logged with the query and the result count.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Showing contact details to coordinators through a new, separate view.\n- Changing what is stored in the members table.\n- Changes to the desk page's catalogue and loans tables.\n\n## Done when\n\n- The new tests in `tests/members/search.test.ts` pass, and the existing tests still pass.\n- `bun run gate` exits 0.\n","numLines":34,"startLine":1,"totalLines":34}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01TRLPsvGhM5mAr3obyN5V97","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
